# System Architecture

The system follows a full-stack web architecture.
                    ATIF HIS
                       │
              ┌────────┴────────┐
              │                 │
       React Frontend     Express Backend
              │                 │
              │          Threat Detection
              │                 │
              │          Threat Correlation
              │                 │
              │          Adaptive Risk Engine
              │                 │
              │          RBAC / Permissions
              │                 │
              └────────┬────────┘
                       │
                Persistent Storage
                       │
                 Local JSON Data

The frontend communicates with the backend through REST API endpoints.


